  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4Ocean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Commission (EC), Directorate-General for Maritime Affairs and Fisheries (DG MARE), in 2020 has launched the European Ocean Coalition (EU4Ocean) for supporting collective actions in the field of Ocean Literacy (OL) in Europe. With the present project, IOC-UNESCO will support and strengthen the activities of the coalition, building on its OL expertise and networks to contribute to the achievement of the overall objectives of the EU4Ocean coalition.</narrative>
  </description>
